      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-remissions-of-sentences-act-2021.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “subsection (3)”, substitute “subsections (3) and (3A)”.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nCrimes Amendment (Remissions of Sentences) Act 2021\nNo. 129, 2021",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “subsection (3)”, substitute “subsections (3) and (3A)”.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nCrimes Amendment (Remissions of Sentences) Act 2021\nNo. 129, 2021",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-remissions-of-sentences-act-2021-sch-1-sec-9-norm"
